A2000 x86 Bridgeboard - licensing summary
==========================================

This repository uses two licences, chosen in decision D-13
(docs/02-rev1-baseline.md):

  Original hardware designs: CERN-OHL-S-2.0 (strongly reciprocal)
    hardware/**   KiCad schematics, symbols, footprints, future PCB files
    full text: LICENSES/CERN-OHL-S-2.0.txt
    Source Location (CERN-OHL-S section 4): https://github.com/GregWinfield/a2000-x86-bridgeboard

  Original HDL, firmware, software and tools: MIT
    hdl/**, firmware/**, software/**, tools/**
    full text: LICENSES/MIT.txt

  Documentation (docs/**) is provided under CERN-OHL-S-2.0 as part of the
  hardware design documentation, unless a file states otherwise.

Third-party material keeps its own licence. See NOTICE.md.

SPDX identifiers: CERN-OHL-S-2.0, MIT
